        "original_id": "6301ac4b-d507-5912-bd6a-06d521220095",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: R. D. Reid, Zack Snyder, George A. Romero, James Gunn, Sarah Polley, Ving Rhames, Jake Weber, Mekhi Phifer, Kevin Zegers\n- Products: Dawn of the Dead (2004 film), Diary of the Dead, Dawn of the Dead (1978 film), Transamerica, It's a Boy Girl Thing, The Jane Austen Book Club, Fifty Dead Men Walking, Frozen\n\nFacts:\n- George A. Romero directed the 1978 film Dawn of the Dead, which was later remade as Dawn of the Dead (2004 film).\n- Dawn of the Dead (2004 film) is a remake of George A. Romero's 1978 film of the same name.\n- James Gunn wrote Dawn of the Dead (2004 film).\n- Dawn of the Dead (2004 film) stars Sarah Polley, Ving Rhames, Jake Weber, and Mekhi Phifer.\n- R. D. Reid appeared in Zack Snyder's Dawn of the Dead and in George A. Romero's Diary of the Dead.\n- Kevin Zegers starred in Dawn of the Dead (2004), Transamerica (2005), It's a Boy Girl Thing (2006), The Jane Austen Book Club (2007), Fifty Dead Men Walking (2008), and Frozen (2010).",
